==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/hwjuː/|/fjuː/|[ʍĭ̥ŭ̥]|[ɸĭ̥ŭ̥]}} <small>[very short and unvoiced]</small>
* {{audio|en|en-us-whew.ogg|a=GA}}
* {{rhymes|en|uː|s=1}}
* {{homophone|en|phew}}

===Etymology 1===

====Interjection====
{{en-interj}}

# {{n-g|An expressive sound made indicating the [[release]] of one's inner [[tension]]; the release of [[breath]]; an expression of [[relief]].}}
#: {{ux|en|{{q|from strenuous labour}} '''Whew!''' That box weighs a ton!}}
#: {{ux|en|{{q|from intense concern}} '''Whew!''' Thank goodness youʼre safe! I thought something terrible had happened to you!}}
#: {{ux|en|{{q|from fear of being seen}} '''Whew!''' That cop didnʼt see me! That was a close call!}}
# {{n-g|An expression of amazement or surprise.}}
#* {{RQ:P. L. Travers Mary Poppins|page=3|text=Now I must be off. '''Whew''', it's as cold as the North Pole. Which way is the wind blowing?}}

